00:09:23.515 --> 00:09:26.388
And so if you were providing
insane value to a YouTuber

00:09:26.388 --> 00:09:27.668
and their channel is exploding,

00:09:27.668 --> 00:09:29.186
they're going to want
to keep you on board.

00:09:29.186 --> 00:09:30.872
Now, the first person you do it for,

00:09:30.872 --> 00:09:32.478
they may not want to keep you on board.

00:09:32.478 --> 00:09:34.953
They may want to steal your
idea and do it all themselves.

00:09:34.953 --> 00:09:36.409
They may not have seen results,

00:09:36.409 --> 00:09:38.239
in which case you didn't do a good job.

00:09:38.239 --> 00:09:40.174
But if you do that a couple times,

00:09:40.174 --> 00:09:42.525
you're not going to get 10 people all say,

00:09:42.525 --> 00:09:43.480
"I'm just going to steal from you

00:09:43.480 --> 00:09:45.230
"and I'm going to pay
you for your service."

00:09:45.230 --> 00:09:46.899
And so it may not work the first time,

00:09:46.899 --> 00:09:47.964
it may not work the second time,

00:09:47.964 --> 00:09:49.665
but the third, fourth, or fifth time,

00:09:49.665 --> 00:09:50.925
it's going to work eventually,

00:09:50.925 --> 00:09:53.624
and you'll find the people
who really value what you do.

00:09:53.624 --> 00:09:54.594
And once you're in,

00:09:54.594 --> 00:09:56.195
you can build a long term
relationship with them.

00:09:56.195 --> 00:09:57.028
You'll get referrals.

00:09:57.028 --> 00:09:58.436
You'll be able to grow this business out.

00:09:58.436 --> 00:09:59.887
And so I would focus on YouTube.

00:09:59.887 --> 00:10:01.687
But for you, maybe it's Instagram.

00:10:01.687 --> 00:10:02.688
Maybe it's Facebook.

00:10:02.688 --> 00:10:03.675
Maybe you love Twitter.

00:10:03.675 --> 00:10:04.633
Maybe it's musical.ly.

00:10:04.633 --> 00:10:08.015
And find the other people who
you can look at in that market

00:10:08.015 --> 00:10:10.626
who are having success but
could be doing way better,

00:10:10.626 --> 00:10:13.689
or helping port people to a new market.

00:10:13.689 --> 00:10:15.279
If somebody is big on YouTube like me

00:10:15.279 --> 00:10:17.366
but isn't doing as much on Snapchat,

00:10:17.366 --> 00:10:18.753
maybe you're the Snapchat king.

00:10:18.753 --> 00:10:20.480
Maybe you understand
everything about Snapchat

00:10:20.480 --> 00:10:22.033
and you're on top of
every algorithm update

00:10:22.033 --> 00:10:23.527
and you're on top of every filter

00:10:23.527 --> 00:10:25.155
and every strategy and every idea,

00:10:25.155 --> 00:10:26.502
and you love my content

00:10:26.502 --> 00:10:28.966
and there's a way that you can
help me explode on Snapchat

00:10:28.966 --> 00:10:31.447
and turn a real ROI on that, talk to me.

00:10:31.447 --> 00:10:33.178
Let's see how we can
make something happen.

00:10:33.178 --> 00:10:34.927
That's the game that you
want to start to get into.

00:10:34.927 --> 00:10:37.020
That's what I would do if I
was starting over right now.

00:10:37.020 --> 00:10:40.111
(rhythmic music)

00:10:40.111 --> 00:10:41.762
Tip number five is start small.

00:10:41.762 --> 00:10:43.176
This is one of the hardest things to do,

00:10:43.176 --> 00:10:45.680
because I remember being 19 years old

00:10:45.680 --> 00:10:48.034
and having big ambitions
and wanting to do big things

00:10:48.034 --> 00:10:49.282
and then being frustrated

00:10:49.282 --> 00:10:51.690
with slow progress and slow results.

00:10:51.690 --> 00:10:54.741
A lot of people put in so
much energy at the start

00:10:54.741 --> 00:10:56.340
and then they burn out,

00:10:56.340 --> 00:10:57.692
and they never really had a chance

00:10:57.692 --> 00:10:59.031
to let their business grow,

00:10:59.031 --> 00:11:01.971
where starting a company
does take some time.

00:11:01.971 --> 00:11:03.184
It's not for lack of effort

00:11:03.184 --> 00:11:04.455
or lack of hustling or lack of work.

00:11:04.455 --> 00:11:07.244
It just doesn't happen the
next week or the next month.

00:11:07.244 --> 00:11:08.666
You've got to put in consistent work.

00:11:08.666 --> 00:11:09.499
If you look at

00:11:09.499 --> 00:11:11.722
any successful entrepreneur
that you look up to,

00:11:11.722 --> 00:11:14.167
they put in consistent,
consistent, consistent work.

00:11:14.167 --> 00:11:15.250
So I'd be looking at,

00:11:15.250 --> 00:11:17.925
what do I need to do to start
small and take daily action?

00:11:17.925 --> 00:11:20.340
That may even mean go get a part time job.

00:11:20.340 --> 00:11:21.916
Go get a job working at,

00:11:21.916 --> 00:11:23.213
now, if you're going to get a job,

00:11:23.213 --> 00:11:25.660
it's not just to earn money but to learn.

00:11:25.660 --> 00:11:27.898
If you want to know YouTube inside out,

00:11:27.898 --> 00:11:30.167
go work for a YouTuber
who's having success

00:11:30.167 --> 00:11:31.413
that you look up to.

00:11:31.413 --> 00:11:33.156
If you want to learn digital marketing,

00:11:33.156 --> 00:11:35.224
go work for a digital marketing company

00:11:35.224 --> 00:11:36.738
that has 10 employees or less

00:11:36.738 --> 00:11:38.200
and take on as much as you can

00:11:38.200 --> 00:11:39.506
to really learn that business.

00:11:39.506 --> 00:11:42.045
You're getting paid to learn the industry.

00:11:42.045 --> 00:11:43.454
So that may be an option.

00:11:43.454 --> 00:11:45.084
And start on the side.

00:11:45.084 --> 00:11:46.865
Research as much as possible.

00:11:46.865 --> 00:11:48.206
Hustle every day.

00:11:48.206 --> 00:11:51.137
Reach out multiple times
to people every single day.

00:11:51.137 --> 00:11:53.283
And eventually, those are
going to turn into wins.

00:11:53.283 --> 00:11:55.714
But you're going to get a lot
of fails, a lot of small nos,

00:11:55.714 --> 00:11:57.786
over and over and over and over again,

00:11:57.786 --> 00:11:59.533
and most people just quit too soon.

00:11:59.533 --> 00:12:00.922
Most people, you may reach out

00:12:00.922 --> 00:12:02.265
to 10 people and you get 10 nos

00:12:02.265 --> 00:12:04.733
or really you have to
reach out to 500 people.

00:12:04.733 --> 00:12:06.563
You're just not putting in enough reps.

00:12:06.563 --> 00:12:07.994
So start small,

00:12:07.994 --> 00:12:10.667
and understand that with
patience and dedicated action,

00:12:10.667 --> 00:12:11.640
you're going to grow.

00:12:11.640 --> 00:12:14.693
(rhythmic music)

00:12:14.693 --> 00:12:16.716
Tip number six is model success.

00:12:16.716 --> 00:12:19.183
One of the great things about any business

00:12:19.183 --> 00:12:21.030
is you can reverse engineer it.

00:12:21.030 --> 00:12:23.505
If somebody has figured out how to do it,

00:12:23.505 --> 00:12:25.272
if somebody looks like
you and has had success,

00:12:25.272 --> 00:12:26.547
you can do it, too.

00:12:26.547 --> 00:12:28.044
A lot of young entrepreneurs came online

00:12:28.044 --> 00:12:30.237
because they saw Mark Zuckerberg
and Facebook take off.

00:12:30.237 --> 00:12:32.527
They see this young guy
becomes a billionaire

00:12:32.527 --> 00:12:34.015
and gets everybody's respect,

00:12:34.015 --> 00:12:36.505
so if he can do it, I can do it, too.

00:12:36.505 --> 00:12:38.729
And so if there's somebody
that looks like you

00:12:38.729 --> 00:12:41.012
who's made it, you can make it, too.

00:12:41.012 --> 00:12:43.650
And being surrounded by
that I think is important,

00:12:43.650 --> 00:12:46.303
because young people more
and more and more and more

00:12:46.303 --> 00:12:48.503
are getting respect in the business world

00:12:48.503 --> 00:12:50.032
because you can provide real value,

00:12:50.032 --> 00:12:52.467
but you may not feel it from
your immediate environment.

00:12:52.467 --> 00:12:53.691
Your parents might think you're crazy,

00:12:53.691 --> 00:12:54.524
like, "What are you doing?

00:12:54.524 --> 00:12:55.357
"You want to be a gamer?

00:12:55.357 --> 00:12:56.190
"What are you talking about?

00:12:56.190 --> 00:12:57.555
"You can't make money on video games."

00:12:57.555 --> 00:12:59.099
The people around you who are older

00:12:59.099 --> 00:13:00.767
who grew up in a different generation,

00:13:00.767 --> 00:13:03.052
they love you, and they're
looking out for you,

00:13:03.052 --> 00:13:04.404
but they may not understand

00:13:04.404 --> 00:13:06.823
how today's economy really, really works.

00:13:06.823 --> 00:13:09.074
And so it's hard to stay

00:13:09.074 --> 00:13:11.349
dedicated to that thing
that you really want to do

00:13:11.349 --> 00:13:13.388
when everybody around you is so negative.

00:13:13.388 --> 00:13:15.953
And so create a better
environment for yourself,

00:13:15.953 --> 00:13:17.033
modeling success.

00:13:17.033 --> 00:13:18.463
Modeling success is what saved my company.

00:13:18.463 --> 00:13:19.296
I was 19.

00:13:19.296 --> 00:13:20.129
I wanted to quit.

00:13:20.129 --> 00:13:21.349
I told my partner, "I quit."

00:13:21.349 --> 00:13:23.929
And looking at Bill Gates
and how he started Microsoft

00:13:23.929 --> 00:13:26.467
gave me a strategy that
I can use for my company,

00:13:26.467 --> 00:13:27.995
and we started to make money.

00:13:27.995 --> 00:13:29.958
And so that really
helped save my business.

00:13:29.958 --> 00:13:31.270
You could do the same.

00:13:31.270 --> 00:13:33.969
It's even easier now because
there's people to reach out to,

00:13:33.969 --> 00:13:35.551
people who are doing live hangouts,

00:13:35.551 --> 00:13:37.682
people who you can send
an Instagram message to

00:13:37.682 --> 00:13:39.034
and they're going to write back to you.

00:13:39.034 --> 00:13:41.768
I wish hangouts was a thing when I was 19.

00:13:41.768 --> 00:13:44.454
I was still going to libraries

00:13:44.454 --> 00:13:48.156
and studying at libraries and
getting research from books.

00:13:48.156 --> 00:13:50.246
Books are still great, I have my own,

00:13:50.246 --> 00:13:52.506
but I wish I had the Internet.

00:13:52.506 --> 00:13:55.171
I wish I had people
that I can connect with.

00:13:55.171 --> 00:13:58.628
I do hangouts almost once
a week on my channel.

00:13:58.628 --> 00:13:59.778
You can reach me.

00:13:59.778 --> 00:14:01.045
You can reach Gary Vaynerchuk.

00:14:01.045 --> 00:14:02.869
You can reach other business leaders.

00:14:02.869 --> 00:14:04.504
You can reach people on Twitter.

00:14:04.504 --> 00:14:06.712
You can connect with people
and ask real questions

00:14:06.712 --> 00:14:08.055
and get feedback on it.

00:14:08.055 --> 00:14:10.113
So I would use that to my advantage.

00:14:10.113 --> 00:14:12.758
You know, being a young person
gives you that advantage

00:14:12.758 --> 00:14:14.070
where people want to give back.

00:14:14.070 --> 00:14:16.409
If it seems genuine,
if it seems authentic,

00:14:16.409 --> 00:14:18.813
if it feels like you really
want to make this thing happen,

00:14:18.813 --> 00:14:22.276
people like giving back because
they see themselves in you.

00:14:22.276 --> 00:14:24.566
They see, like if you write to me,

00:14:24.566 --> 00:14:25.753
anytime somebody writes to me, is like,

00:14:25.753 --> 00:14:27.388
"Hey, I'm a 13 year old entrepreneur,"

00:14:27.388 --> 00:14:28.780
I think of myself at 13.

00:14:28.780 --> 00:14:30.736
It's like, "Man, how awesome would it be

00:14:30.736 --> 00:14:32.094
"to be able to reach out to somebody

00:14:32.094 --> 00:14:33.909
"who's accomplished more
than me when I was 13

00:14:33.909 --> 00:14:35.293
"and get direct feedback?"

00:14:35.293 --> 00:14:37.004
And so doing the work.

00:14:37.004 --> 00:14:38.561
If you're going to ask
for questions, though,

00:14:38.561 --> 00:14:39.706
ask for one question.

00:14:39.706 --> 00:14:40.964
Don't ask for a million questions.

00:14:40.964 --> 00:14:42.717
One question, and then do the work.

00:14:42.717 --> 00:14:45.491
Do not come back to that same
person, ask another question,

00:14:45.491 --> 00:14:46.554
until you did the work

00:14:46.554 --> 00:14:48.246
on the first thing that you asked for.

00:14:48.246 --> 00:14:49.770
Otherwise, you're wasting their time.

00:14:49.770 --> 00:14:53.238
(rhythmic music)

00:14:53.238 --> 00:14:55.362
And then tip number seven is
create a great environment.

00:14:55.362 --> 00:14:56.713
And I talked a little bit about that

00:14:56.713 --> 00:14:57.718
on the modeling success,

00:14:57.718 --> 00:15:01.067
but you have people around
you who are discouraging you,

00:15:01.067 --> 00:15:02.330
and you're trying to do

00:15:02.330 --> 00:15:03.972
one of the most difficult
things in the world,

00:15:03.972 --> 00:15:05.006
which is start a business.

00:15:05.006 --> 00:15:05.839
It's no joke.

00:15:05.839 --> 00:15:07.267
It's not an easy, overnight thing.

00:15:07.267 --> 00:15:09.725
There's a lot of dedicated
work that has to go into it,

00:15:09.725 --> 00:15:11.147
and if you have people around you

00:15:11.147 --> 00:15:12.373
who don't support your vision,

00:15:12.373 --> 00:15:14.141
it's really hard to get that going.

00:15:14.141 --> 00:15:15.884
And so I'd be looking at my environment,

00:15:15.884 --> 00:15:17.724
my physical environment,
like where are you working?

00:15:17.724 --> 00:15:18.638
Working out of your bedroom?

00:15:18.638 --> 00:15:19.471
Great.

00:15:19.471 --> 00:15:20.418
What's on the walls?

00:15:20.418 --> 00:15:21.632
What are you looking at every day?

00:15:21.632 --> 00:15:22.790
What inspires you?

00:15:22.790 --> 00:15:24.133
What's your morning routine?

00:15:24.133 --> 00:15:25.727
Ever day, you need to start your morning

00:15:25.727 --> 00:15:27.736
with something that inspires
you, makes you feel like

00:15:27.736 --> 00:15:29.727
you can be an entrepreneur
and have success,

00:15:29.727 --> 00:15:31.190
whether that's watching one of my videos,

00:15:31.190 --> 00:15:33.695
reading a book, watching
somebody else's videos,

00:15:33.695 --> 00:15:36.324
tuning into somebody's
Snapchat, whatever it is,

00:15:36.324 --> 00:15:38.605
whatever the thing is that
gets you feeling confident

00:15:38.605 --> 00:15:41.851
that I can go out and do this,
do that every single morning.

00:15:41.851 --> 00:15:44.759
Because otherwise, you're
going to get too discouraged.

00:15:44.759 --> 00:15:45.717
You're going to have moments

00:15:45.717 --> 00:15:47.467
of excitement and, "I can do anything,"

00:15:47.467 --> 00:15:48.762
and then you're going to fall back down

00:15:48.762 --> 00:15:50.041
and you're not going to work for a week

00:15:50.041 --> 00:15:51.725
because your parents are hating on you

00:15:51.725 --> 00:15:53.036
or your friends are hating on you

00:15:53.036 --> 00:15:54.453
or your teachers say you're
never going to do anything

00:15:54.453 --> 00:15:56.189
in the entrepreneurship world.

00:15:56.189 --> 00:15:58.382
So having that daily, consistent action

00:15:58.382 --> 00:16:01.910
to make you feel bold, confident,
powerful, entrepreneurial

00:16:01.910 --> 00:16:03.007
is super important.

00:16:03.007 --> 00:16:05.381
Whatever that thing is that
gets you juiced and motivated,

00:16:05.381 --> 00:16:07.427
every single morning, start with it.

00:16:07.427 --> 00:16:10.008
And it can't be the same video.

00:16:10.008 --> 00:16:14.247
Like the same video or the
same song will phase out.

00:16:14.247 --> 00:16:16.392
You could watch this video
once and be motivated,

00:16:16.392 --> 00:16:17.919
the next day, a little bit more motivated,

00:16:17.919 --> 00:16:20.943
and then it'll start to,
it's going to fall off.

00:16:20.943 --> 00:16:22.752
So you need a source.

00:16:22.752 --> 00:16:24.322
That's why I make videos daily,

00:16:24.322 --> 00:16:25.938
because there's always something new

00:16:25.938 --> 00:16:27.705
for people to digest and consume

00:16:27.705 --> 00:16:30.642
and feel good about themselves
on and learn something from.

00:16:30.642 --> 00:16:32.599
But if it's an author you like,

00:16:32.599 --> 00:16:33.965
read a different book of theirs.

00:16:33.965 --> 00:16:36.023
You go through a couple pages a day.

00:16:36.023 --> 00:16:38.180
Or again, somebody who's
consistent on Snapchat.

00:16:38.180 --> 00:16:40.633
It's not about that one snap
six months ago that they did.

00:16:40.633 --> 00:16:41.702
It's the next one that they do

00:16:41.702 --> 00:16:42.736
and the next one that they do.

00:16:42.736 --> 00:16:44.252
So having that constant source

00:16:44.252 --> 00:16:46.481
of new motivation for you every single day

00:16:46.481 --> 00:16:48.707
and starting your day with
it is super important.

00:16:48.707 --> 00:16:51.037
So those are my seven
tips on how to make money

00:16:51.037 --> 00:16:52.529
as a teenage entrepreneur.

00:16:52.529 --> 00:16:53.757
Thank you so much for watching.

00:16:53.757 --> 00:16:54.636
I hope you enjoyed.

00:16:54.636 --> 00:16:56.476
I'd love to know, which
was your favorite tip?

00:16:56.476 --> 00:16:57.879
What did you enjoy the most?

